Package: freedomnas-core
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.7)
Recommends: zfsutils-linux | zfs-fuse
Description: FreedomNAS Core Engine — OS-agnostic storage appliance
 The FreedomNAS Core Engine provides:
  • Universal OS abstraction via JSON Translator Layer
  • Support for Debian, FreeBSD, and Arch Linux
  • ZFS pool and dataset management
  • Network and user configuration
  • System provisioning and disaster recovery
 .
 Install this package to get the freedomnas.engine and freedomnas.config
 Python modules for building storage appliances and deployment tools.
